            "review_text": "marchelmond\nHelmond, The Netherlands23 contributions\n0\nExcelent Japanese fine dining\nOct 2016 • Friends\nIn this restaurant located in a Japanese business tower we enjoyed the food very much. Besides the shasimi, sushi, tempura and salade,we had some nice croquettes with oysters and grilled salmon and another grilled fish. When you love fine Japanese food this is one of the places to go to in Hanoi.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 27, 2016",
